'''Parade of the Dead (Deadly)''' is an [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] that was added in [[Version 5.9 Update|Version 5.9]] and appears on the '''3rd''', '''4th''', '''17th''', and '''18th''' of every month. When clearing this stage, there is a chance to unlock [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Curling Cat]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage. The stage's [[Abyssal Stage|Abyssal version]] was added in [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is unlocked once clearing [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 10|Floor 10]] of the [[Heavenly Tower]].

