|Hyper Mr.
|Shigong Cat|50
|talent4 = Defense Buff Lv. 10
|Cameraman Cat|50
|talent5 = Survives Lv. 10
|name = Lineup 1
|cannon = Holy Blast
}}

'''difficulty:''' ★☆☆☆☆

'''Battle:''' Start by spamming Shigong Cats and upgrading your wallet. As soon as the Angels appear, start spamming Cameraman Cats to deal with them, then continue to swarm Daboo with just Shigong Cats once he's dead. The Zombies pose no issue whatsoever, so take the opportunity to deal as much damage to him and hopefully kill him before the second Angel wave appears.

{{Lineup
|Slapstick Cats
|Nyalladin
|Val Val Cat
|Kiss and Koi
|Noodle Cats
|Ramen Cat|50
|talent6 = Defense Buff Lv. 10
|Courier Cat|50
|Manic Macho Legs|30
|name = Lineup 2
|cannon = Holy Blast
|notes = You can beat this stage without the Cat Combo if your Ramen Cat is Lv.70.
}}

'''difficulty:''' ★★☆☆☆

'''Battle:''' Spam Ramen and Courier Cat. Ramen Cat does well to stall out every enemy here, all while Courier Cat deals slow but consistent chip damage from the back. Use the Manic Macho Legs to deal additional damage on each of the major Angel/Zombie waves. If the enemies ever reach the Cat Base, feel free to deploy Slapstick Cats as additional chip damage.

{{Lineup
|Doctor Cat
|Island Cat|20+60
|Manic Island Cat|50
|Awakened Bahamut Cat|40
|talent4 = Explosion Lv. 10, Immune to Slow
|name = Lineup 3
|cannon = Holy Blast
}}

'''difficulty:''' ★★★☆☆

'''Battle:''' Wait until you have ¢2,000, then send out Manic Island Cat. He will bait out an attack from Daboo right around the point where you're able to afford Awakened Bahamut Cat, so try to send him out as soon as you can (where he won't be sniped by Daboo's Omni Strike). Bahamut will continuously chunk Daboo's health bar, and can survive a hit thanks to Moby Dick. While this is happening, spam Island Cat and Manic Island Cat to shield Bahamut from the Gabriel onslaughts. As soon as Daboo is about to initiate his finishing blow on Bahamut, Holy Blast him to reset his attack animation so that Bahamut can do even more damage before dying. Once he does die, kill the Angelic Hippoes with your Island Cat duo, and simply wait for a second Awakened Bahamut Cat to finish the job. He should be able to destroy the base before the second wave of Angels spawns.

{{Lineup
