|notes = Slime Cat works in place of Jelly Dumpling Cat, but is far too inconsistent to practical. Housewife Cat is not required, but makes the strategy more consistent.
}}

'''difficulty:''' ★☆☆☆☆

'''Battle:''' Can Can and Housewife Cat will be doing most of the heavy lifting in terms of damaging the heavy hitters. Jelly Dumpling Cat is here to clear the spontaneous waves of small peons, and thus, allow your Can Cans the opportunity to land good hits. Their Wave Attacks also help with nuking unburrowing Zombies while simultaneously hitting the frontline. Just time your Jelly Dumpling Cats right and victory will be trivial.

