'''difficulty:''' ★★☆☆☆/☆☆☆☆☆

'''Battle:''' Eraser and Green Shell Cat holds the lines while Fishman Cat steadily chips Daboo. However, life is not so easy; you will need to start spawning Mushroom Cats to devastate the Angel waves, since they're too powerful for Fishman Cat to handle alone. They also serve as good supplemental damage against Zir Zeal and the Zories. Use the moments of downtime to upgrade your wallet so you don't run out of cash mid-wave.

Alternatively, if you're using Rich Cat, you can just activate a Cat CPU and just sit back.

